{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/gym_mizu_010.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/gym_mizu_010.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "C38DF125E6D2FF90",
      "text": "吁～！\\n要迟到，要迟到～！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "7C6C59D62A6DB258",
      "text": "啊～！海岱！\\n等一下～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "7C6C5CD62A6DB771",
      "text": "啊～就这么走掉了。\\n你忘带了一样东西呀……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "7C6C5BD62A6DB5BE",
      "text": "莫非你是要去道馆的\\n挑战者，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D3677BC9BEA50865",
      "text": "对！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D36778C9BEA5034C",
      "text": "是吗……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04a",
      "hash64": "D9DFDBEA18744342",
      "text": "果然没错！我猜对了吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_04b",
      "hash64": "D9DFDAEA1874418F",
      "text": "你虽然嘴上那么说，\\n但一定是挑战者！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "7C6C5DD62A6DB924",
      "text": "刚才那位壮硕的大叔是\\n玻瓶道馆的馆主海岱。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "7C6C60D62A6DBE3D",
      "text": "他这个人啊，就像个孩子一样，\\n明明要去市场采购，\\r\\n却忘了带钱包。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "7C6C5FD62A6DBC8A",
      "text": "海岱现在一定正在发愁……\\c\\n这位亲切的挑战者！\\n你能帮忙把钱包交给他吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08a",
      "hash64": "D9B6D3EA18513096",
      "text": "啊啊，你怎么会这么亲切！\\n搞得我现在就想在这里\\r\\n把道馆徽章给你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_08b",
      "hash64": "D9B6D2EA18512EE3",
      "text": "不好意思，海岱不在的话，\\n就不能进行道馆挑战。\\r\\n而且我也不能离开前台……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "7C6C51D62A6DA4C0",
      "text": "那么，这东西就拜托你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "7C6954D62A6B7402",
      "text": "如果你能把钱包交给他，\\n就破例让你通过道馆测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "7C6955D62A6B75B5",
      "text": "海岱前往的是需要穿过西边的沙漠\\n才能到达的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]渍沁镇[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "7C6952D62A6B709C",
      "text": "沙漠里也有很多危险的宝可梦，\\n你可要小心～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
